 "readmeHTML": "<div id=\"readme\" class=\"md\" data-path=\"docs/README.md\"><article class=\"markdown-body entry-content container-lg\" itemprop=\"text\"><div align=\"center\" dir=\"auto\">\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"./mmrs.svg\"><img src=\"./mmrs.svg\" alt=\"An implementation of a metamodule\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h1 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Magic Mount Metamodule</h1><a id=\"user-content-magic-mount-metamodule\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Magic Mount Metamodule\" href=\"#magic-mount-metamodule\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://t.me/mmrs_ci\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/36a8720ac8a4946834cd8fb2cff8acfc01f3a037058ce494ddff6d225442d97a/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f62616467652f47726f75702d626c75653f7374796c653d666f722d7468652d6261646765266c6f676f3d74656c656772616d266c6162656c3d54656c656772616d\" alt=\"Telegram\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Group-blue?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=telegram&amp;label=Telegram\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/releases/latest\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/c037629be07f0f412fd306c3c825253a0c361904c4abaeb18aad83e2982351e7/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f762f72656c656173652f546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d72733f6c6f676f3d676974687562\" alt=\"Version\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/v/release/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs?logo=github\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/releases/\"><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/403c0e189da4f899a0cd63a2d938e6968506877dc85f7c7edeb73325ed8ff4b6/68747470733a2f2f696d672e736869656c64732e696f2f6769746875622f646f776e6c6f6164732f546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d72732f746f74616c3f6c6f676f3d676974687562266c6f676f436f6c6f723d677265656e\" alt=\"GitHub Downloads\" data-canonical-src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/downloads/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/total?logo=github&amp;logoColor=green\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"></a></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"README_en.md\">English</a> <a href=\"README_ru.md\">Русский</a></p>\n</div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">为 KernelSU/APatch 提供 Systemless 修改功能。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">作者由于学业原因，更新会放缓</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">配置</h2><a id=\"user-content-配置\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 配置\" href=\"#配置\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">配置文件路径：</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>/data/adb/magic_mount/config.toml</code></p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-toml notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"mountsource = &quot;KSU&quot;\numount = false\npartitions = []\nextra_mount = []\"><pre><span class=\"pl-smi\">mountsource</span> = <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>KSU<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">umount</span> = <span class=\"pl-c1\">false</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">partitions</span> = []\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">extra_mount</span> = []</pre></div>\n<markdown-accessiblity-table><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>字段</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>mountsource</td>\n<td>Systemless 挂载来源标识。默认值 \"KSU\" 与 KernelSU 行为保持一致。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>umount</td>\n<td>是否尝试卸载（依赖 KernelSU umount ）。</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>partitions</td>\n<td>指定需要进行 Systemless 操作的特定分区列表，例如 \"mi_ext\",\"my_stock\" 等。</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></markdown-accessiblity-table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>extra_mount</code> 默认 <code>[]</code>。例如 <code>extra_mount = [\"my_product\"]</code> 将 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/my_product/</code> 内容合并挂载到 <code>/my_product/</code>，不从 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/system/my_product/</code> 读取。要求目标目录已存在，且 <code>/system/my_product</code> 完全没有目录项（包括悬空符号链接）。只填写单级分区名，不填写路径；无效条目记录日志并跳过。没有 <code>system/</code> 的模块也受支持，仍遵循 <code>disable</code>、<code>remove</code> 和 <code>skip_mount</code> 标记。编辑配置后重启生效。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">也可通过 WEBUI 配置页修改（推荐）；MiuiX 和 MD3 均提供“额外挂载分区（模块顶层）”编辑控件，支持添加和删除 <code>extra_mount</code> 分区名。保存后重启生效。</p>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">目录标记</h2><a id=\"user-content-目录标记\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 目录标记\" href=\"#目录标记\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">在模块对应目录中创建空标记文件，重启后生效：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>.replace</code>：用模块目录内容替换目标目录，不保留原有内容。</li>\n<li><code>.remove</code>：隐藏整个目标目录及其内容，例如 <code>&lt;模块&gt;/system/app/Foo/.remove</code> 隐藏 <code>/system/app/Foo</code>。仅对目录节点生效，不支持对普通文件或符号链接添加此属性；原始文件不会被删除。</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>.remove</code> 优先于同目录的 <code>.replace</code>，该目录内的模块内容不会挂载。两种标记文件本身均不挂载，<code>extra_mount</code> 下的目录采用相同用法。模块根目录的 <code>remove</code>（无点号）仍表示移除模块，与 <code>.remove</code> 不同。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">自定义 Lua 钩子</h2><a id=\"user-content-自定义-lua-钩子\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 自定义 Lua 钩子\" href=\"#自定义-lua-钩子\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">将 Lua 5.5 脚本放入 <code>/data/adb/magic_mount/lua/</code>，重启生效。只加载该目录直接子级的普通 <code>.lua</code> 文件，按文件名升序，不加载符号链接或子目录。目录不存在表示没有脚本，每个脚本有独立的 Lua VM。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">文件头必须声明 <code>API = 1</code> 或 <code>API = 2</code>；API 2 随后声明 <code>MODULE = \"模块 ID\"</code>。每个字面量声明独占一行，允许前导空行、Lua 注释和单双引号。API 和 MODULE 运行时只读。旧 <code>bind</code> 改为 <code>bind_mount</code>；旧 <code>modules[id].skip</code> 改为 API 2 的 <code>skip()</code>。旧 custom/custom.lua 不再读取，WebUI 不编辑脚本。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">API 1 仅提供挂载函数 <code>bind_mount(source, target)</code>，在可选的 <code>before()/after()</code> 中调用：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"API = 1\n\nfunction before()\n    bind_mount(&quot;/data/local/tmp/before.conf&quot;, &quot;/system/etc/before.conf&quot;)\nend\n\nfunction after()\n    bind_mount(&quot;/data/local/tmp/hosts&quot;, &quot;/system/etc/hosts&quot;)\nend\"><pre><span class=\"pl-smi\">API</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">1</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">before</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">bind_mount</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/data/local/tmp/before.conf<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/system/etc/before.conf<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">after</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">bind_mount</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/data/local/tmp/hosts<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/system/etc/hosts<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">全部 before 按文件名顺序排队。模块规则和挂载树准备成功后，在 Magic Mount 之前执行这些 bind；目标可能被后续 Magic Mount 覆盖。全部 after 仅在 Magic Mount 成功后运行，所有 after 成功才执行其 bind。目标必须是绝对路径，路径不能为空、包含控制字符或 <code>..</code> 分量。bind 保持只读；目标不存在时，从最近存在的非根祖先创建临时镜像。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">API 2 根据 module.prop 的 ID 匹配 MODULE，不假设目录名等于 ID。扫描模块挂载内容前，按模块 ID 查找匹配的脚本并调用无参数 <code>load()</code>，同一模块的脚本按文件名执行。未安装或带 disable、remove、skip_mount 标记的模块不执行 load。仅在 API 2 的 load 内提供：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><code>skip()</code>：跳过整个模块的挂载内容扫描与挂载，取消该模块全部规则，忽略后续规则，并停止同模块后续脚本。无参数且幂等；用 <code>return</code> 提前结束当前 Lua 回调。不创建 skip_mount 文件。</li>\n<li><code>block(path)</code>：仅排除当前模块提供的文件或目录，保留系统原内容和其他模块贡献。</li>\n<li><code>replace(source, target)</code>：源是绝对路径的普通文件或目录，目标是模块相对路径。目录整体替换，源不能是符号链接或特殊设备，同路径最后一次声明生效。</li>\n<li><code>remove(path)</code>：在最终挂载视图中隐藏文件、符号链接或目录，包括其他模块同路径贡献，不删除磁盘原内容。不支持移除分区根目录。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"API = 2\nMODULE = &quot;example_module&quot;\n\nfunction load()\n    block(&quot;system/etc/unwanted.conf&quot;)\n    replace(&quot;/data/local/tmp/hosts&quot;, &quot;system/etc/hosts&quot;)\n    remove(&quot;system/app/Example&quot;)\nend\"><pre><span class=\"pl-smi\">API</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-c1\">2</span>\n<span class=\"pl-smi\">MODULE</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">=</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>example_module<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"pl-k\">function</span> <span class=\"pl-en\">load</span>()\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">block</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>system/etc/unwanted.conf<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">replace</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>/data/local/tmp/hosts<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>system/etc/hosts<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n    <span class=\"pl-c1\">remove</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>system/app/Example<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>)\n<span class=\"pl-k\">end</span></pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">跳过整个模块时，将 load 的函数体改为 <code>skip(); return</code>。相对路径以模块根目录为基准，包含 <code>system/</code> 或已配置的 extra_mount 分区名，例如 <code>my_product/etc/example.xml</code>。拒绝绝对目标、空路径、控制字符及 <code>..</code>。skip 优先于全部规则，其余优先级为 remove &gt; block &gt; replace，父级 block/remove 支配后代。没有 system/ 的模块也能通过规则贡献挂载。模块按 ID 排序，普通冲突保留先到贡献；block/replace 在本模块合并前生效，remove 在最终树生效。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>moduledir</code> 是模块根目录（/data/adb/modules）。Lua 提供基础库及 table/string/math/utf8，不提供 os/io/package/debug、文件加载器、rawset 和 setmetatable。加载、before、load 或挂载树准备错误会在挂载前终止；after 错误取消该阶段 bind，不回滚已完成的 Magic Mount。可信本地脚本没有时间或内存配额。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">modules 命令和 WebUI 按模块 ID 从启动快照恢复 is_mounted、mode 和 rules；查询不执行脚本。skip 模块保留在列表中并显示未挂载，只影响本次启动。快照描述启动计划，不是逐文件挂载成功审计。</p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">开发</h2><a id=\"user-content-开发\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 开发\" href=\"#开发\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">依赖：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Rust nightly toolchain</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Android NDK</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">cargo-ndk</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Node.js / npm</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><code>pnpm</code> and <code>vite</code> as dependency and frontend for webui</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">环境变量：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"export ANDROID_NDK_HOME=&lt;path/to/ndk&gt;\nexport ANDROID_NDK_ROOT=$ANDROID_NDK_HOME\n\"><pre><span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> ANDROID_NDK_HOME=<span class=\"pl-k\">&lt;</span>path/to/ndk<span class=\"pl-k\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"pl-k\">export</span> ANDROID_NDK_ROOT=<span class=\"pl-smi\">$ANDROID_NDK_HOME</span>\n</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">构建：</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-shell notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"cargo xtask build\"><pre>cargo xtask build</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Android lint 与最低支持的 API 26 对齐：\n<code>cargo ndk --platform 26 -t arm64-v8a -t armeabi-v7a clippy -- -D warnings</code>。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">构建产物将位于：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li>output/magic_mount_rs-*.zip</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">致谢</h2><a id=\"user-content-致谢\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 致谢\" href=\"#致谢\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<ul dir=\"auto\">\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/5ec1cff/KernelSU/blob/52f1f575ce2bd0ca46ebf644fd00a838af9f344e/userspace/ksud/src/magic_mount.rs\">5ec1cff/KernelSU</a> — Magic Mount 原始实现</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/YuzakiKokuban\">YuzakiKokuban</a> — WebUI 改进</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/shadow3aaa/fas-rs\">shadow3aaa/fas-rs</a> — 配置与 Lua 扩展的模块结构参考</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">许可证</h2><a id=\"user-content-许可证\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: 许可证\" href=\"#许可证\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"http://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">GPL-v3 许可证</a></p>\n<div class=\"markdown-heading\" dir=\"auto\"><h2 class=\"heading-element\" dir=\"auto\">Star History</h2><a id=\"user-content-star-history\" class=\"anchor\" aria-label=\"Permalink: Star History\" href=\"#star-history\"><svg data-component=\"Octicon\" class=\"octicon octicon-link\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\" version=\"1.1\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m7.775 3.275 1.25-1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1 4.95 4.95l-2.5 2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1-4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1 .018-1.042.751.751 0 0 1 1.042-.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l2.5-2.5a2.002 2.002 0 0 0-2.83-2.83l-1.25 1.25a.751.751 0 0 1-1.042-.018.751.751 0 0 1-.018-1.042Zm-4.69 9.64a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 2.83 0l1.25-1.25a.751.751 0 0 1 1.042.018.751.751 0 0 1 .018 1.042l-1.25 1.25a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-4.95-4.95l2.5-2.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 4.95 0 .751.751 0 0 1-.018 1.042.751.751 0 0 1-1.042.018 1.998 1.998 0 0 0-2.83 0l-2.5 2.5a1.998 1.998 0 0 0 0 2.83Z\"></path></svg></a></div>\n<a href=\"https://star-history.dera.page/#Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n <themed-picture data-catalyst-inline=\"true\"><picture>\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/805204d88f29fe042c804120bed80be91b825a48619119ae3175b59c7f6db690/68747470733a2f2f737461722d686973746f72792e646572612e706167652f7376673f7265706f733d546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d7273267468656d653d6461726b\" data-canonical-src=\"https://star-history.dera.page/svg?repos=Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs&amp;theme=dark\">\n   <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/74f1bcd0ce9e923111555e894ade2dfcc6f13605ddecf55c629d809b6f2b715f/68747470733a2f2f737461722d686973746f72792e646572612e706167652f7376673f7265706f733d546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d7273\" data-canonical-src=\"https://star-history.dera.page/svg?repos=Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs\">\n   <img alt=\"Star History Chart\" src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/74f1bcd0ce9e923111555e894ade2dfcc6f13605ddecf55c629d809b6f2b715f/68747470733a2f2f737461722d686973746f72792e646572612e706167652f7376673f7265706f733d546f6f6c732d63782d6170702f6d6574612d6d616769635f6d6f756e742d7273\" data-canonical-src=\"https://star-history.dera.page/svg?repos=Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs\">\n </picture></themed-picture>\n</a>\n</article></div>",
