   "descriptionHTML": "<h2>What's Changed in 4.2.0</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>project: reorganize the Rust runtime into framework and platform modules by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app\">@Tools-cx-app</a></li>\n<li>lua!: refactor Lua code for improved readability and performance by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/Tools-cx-app/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app\">@Tools-cx-app</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/219\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/219/hovercard\">#219</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): update rust crate zip to v9.9.0 by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/renovate/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/renovate\">@renovate</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/221\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/221/hovercard\">#221</a></li>\n<li>chore(deps): update dependency @types/node to v26.6.7 by <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/renovate/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/renovate\">@renovate</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/220\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/Tools-cx-app/meta-magic_mount-rs/pull/220/hovercard\">#220</a></li>\n<li>Add Brazilian Portuguese